 of valves for the water and sewage industry, extending to irrigation, hydro-power and desalination applications. Its latest filed annual accounts are for 2025, showing sales revenue of 18356316.00 NOK, an operating result of -2406748.00 NOK and total equity of -4798098.00 NOK, with the accounts audited. Compared with 2024, when sales revenue was 29077995.00 NOK, revenue fell and the company moved from an operating result of 2863080.00 NOK to a loss in 2025. Morgan Andersson and Paul Egil Andersson are listed as daglig leder (managing director), with Morgan Andersson as styrets leder (board chair) and Paul Egil Andersson and Ester Andersson as board members, as of 2022-05-19. The company's registered employee count was updated on 2026-10-13, and the registry records salary costs of 4026308.00 NOK for 2025.","sentences":[{"text":"AVM Valves AS is an Aksjeselskap (private limited company) in the industry of producing taps and valves, based at Halfdan Wilhelmsens alle 50, 3117 TØNSBERG.","claim_ids":["c3","c4","c5"]},{"text":"The company describes itself as a world-renowned manufacturer of valves for the water and sewage industry, extending to irrigation, hydro-power and desalination applications.","claim_ids":["c70"]},{"text":"Its latest filed annual accounts are for 2025, showing sales revenue of 18356316.00 NOK, an operating result of -2406748.00 NOK and total equity of -4798098.00 NOK, with the accounts audited.","claim_ids":["c66","c55","c56","c62","c64"]},{"text":"Compared with 2024, when sales revenue was 29077995.00 NOK, revenue fell and the company moved from an operating result of 2863080.00 NOK to a loss in 2025.","claim_ids":["c44","c45","c56"]},{"text":"Morgan Andersson and Paul Egil Andersson are listed as daglig leder (managing director), with Morgan Andersson as styrets leder (board chair) and Paul Egil Andersson and Ester Andersson as board members, as of 2022-05-19.","claim_ids":["c24","c25","c26","c27","c28"]},{"text":"The company's registered employ